License: GPL-3.0-only
AuthorName: linuxtuts
SourceCode: https://github.com/linuxtuts-website/StealthStep
IssueTracker: https://github.com/linuxtuts-website/StealthStep/issues

Summary: Offline GPS pedometer and telemetry tracker
Description: |-
    StealthStep is a privacy-first, 100% offline fitness tracker. 
    It uses raw GPS coordinates to calculate distance and stores all telemetry data locally via SQLite. 
    No accounts, no external servers, no background tracking.

